      "text": "The Blue Streak ambusher designates a single creature they can see and hear, or one they're Tracking, as their prey. The ambusher gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to Seek the prey and to Survival checks to Track the prey. This effect lasts until the Blue Streak ambusher uses Hunt Prey again.",
